# Mechatron Prime CI build targets for dotfiles (Thelio x86_64-linux worker).
# One valid Nix flake attribute per line; verified green 2026-07-25.
#
# checks.test runs bin/run_test_suite over everything except the entries in
# bin/test/NOT_HERMETIC, which the sandbox cannot provide (hardware, network,
# a terminal, the user's account, sibling ~/Code repos). That exclusion list is
# committed and printed in full by the check, so the CI log always states what
# was left out. The complete suite still runs locally and is what the pre-push
# gate requires.
checks.x86_64-linux.test
